  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Jack Setton is a French entrepreneur who built his fortune distributing consumer electronics, particularly Pioneer hi-fi and car stereos. He founded his own group in 1973; his father Joseph had made a separate fortune importing American goods. Setton also assembled a notable racing-car collection and published a book of photography.",
    "html": "<p>Jack Setton is a French entrepreneur who built his fortune distributing consumer electronics, particularly Pioneer hi-fi and car stereos. He founded his own group in 1973; his father Joseph had made a separate fortune importing American goods. Setton also assembled a notable racing-car collection and published a book of photography.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 50,
    "confidence": {
